    <item>
      <title>Java解析MySQL的binlog日志</title>
      <link>https://jhlzlove.github.io/post/skill/programming/java/other/java-parse-mysql-binlog/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (jhlz)</author>
      <guid>https://jhlzlove.github.io/post/skill/programming/java/other/java-parse-mysql-binlog/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Java解析MySQL的binlog日志</h1><p>作者：jhlz（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <p>由于工作需要，研究了一下 Java 解析 MySQL 的 binlog，使用第三方封装的库，可以获取实时插入的信息数据，满足要求。总体看下来使用还是很简单的。</p>
<ol>
<li>引入 binlog 的解析库</li>
</ol>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;groupId&gt;</span>com.zendesk<span class="nt">&lt;/groupId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;artifactId&gt;</span>mysql-binlog-connector-java<span class="nt">&lt;/artifactId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;version&gt;</span>0.28.0<span class="nt">&lt;/version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;/dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>Github：https://github.com/osheroff/mysql-binlog-connector-java</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2025-10-27首发于<a href='https://jhlzlove.github.io/'>浮生一梦</a>，最后修改于2025-10-27</p>]]>
